Common Patterns
System + User Message
[
  { "role": "system", "content": "You are {{role}}" },
  { "role": "user", "content": "{{query}}" }
]

Few-Shot Examples
prompts:
  - |-
    Classify the sentiment:

    Text: "I love this!" → Positive
    Text: "This is terrible" → Negative
    Text: "{{text}}" →

Chain of Thought
